      "content": "thanks. okay, so like... there's been a lot of noise lately about those protests in the capitol and the stuff with the trade embargoes. to anyone else it just looks like standard political friction, but i've been tracking the timing and it's clearly a smokescreen for those shipments moving through the north corridor. i can't say that here, obviously. how do i ask about the logistics of those north corridor shipments without sounding like i'm looking for patterns or something?",
